{"title":"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88843c51e606619a519f39a9a02eb1c7cdf3ccf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\left \\{1,2,3,\\ldots ,n\\right \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />. Determine the number of subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> contains at least two\nelements and such that no two elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> differ by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when\n</p><p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dcc1b21210db29332b1a7d9ce088fd457f23aeee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/731fff2fc30062dd7135caff108b191df21ea8bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>(c) generalize for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9501915f08ed1cf295fdd389481801277bcb2e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$133$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />  \n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/8/6a87d8f8c7880b2cfc37c3e4cb8d5ae936cd0d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{19}{2}+\\binom{18}{3}+\\binom{17}{4}+\\cdots \\binom{11}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"272\" height=\"53\" />   \n</p><p>(c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfee32554915b2ab61266a16e8943857f84181ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n-1}{2}+\\binom{n-2}{3}+\\binom{n-3}{4}+\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"297\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II\">2009 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_UNCO_Math_Cont